The launcher's save synchronization rules follow ground worked out by:
- StS2-Launcher_Mod_Manager: https://github.com/iunius612/StS2-Launcher_Mod_Manager
  MIT. An Android launcher for another Steam game, whose documented save
  failures shaped ours: an unknown cloud state must not be read as an empty
  one, every cloud write goes through one guarded funnel, and a conflict is a
  choice the player makes. No code was taken.
